    <string name="folder_rules">Put each topic in a separate lowercase-slug.json file, directly in the selected folder. Categories come from the JSON. The optional daily-quotes.json file replaces the daily thoughts list. Subfolders and non-JSON files are ignored. Topic and question IDs must be unique, including bundled topics. Keep IDs unchanged to retain progress. If a reload fails, topics and daily thoughts stay unchanged. After an app restart, folder content requires a successful reload.</string>
